    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Once every millennium, the greatest magical beings gather together in order to engage one another in mystical combat.</i></strong><br>This is MagiCarnage. A tournament held to prove who is the strongest magic user in the realm, and worthy of the title &quot;Champion Magus&quot;.<br><br>MagiCarnage is a top down, arena-fighting twin-stick shooter game. <br>You will play as magical beings and engage in battles with others utilizing a large selection of unique and powerful spells.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Online Multiplayer!<br></li><li> Local Multiplayer!<br></li><li> Single Player Mode!<br></li><li> Partial Controller Support!<br></li><li> Customizable loadouts!<br></li><li> Tons of unique spells &amp; skins!<br></li><li> Plenty of achievements to unlock!<br><br><strong>(Controllers are required for local multiplayer)</strong></li></ul>",
